Basic project plan

-> Simple plug and play interface for any instrument using pastream;

-> Ability to choose active listening device and output speaker;

-> Provide live monitoring with minimal latency;

->  Provide effects such as
    -> Distortion;
    -> Reverb;
    -> Delay;
    -> Noise Gate;
    -> Overdrive;

-> Have the ability to record a session;

-> Save the recordings to the disk;

-> Create presets and give ability to load and store presets;